<Positioned left="244" top="1240"><Text fontSize="18" color="#1E2A22FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">购买与产地说明</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="244" top="1274" width="900" height="20"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="14" color="#2C3B31FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">支付：现金 / 微信 / 支付宝；会员价需出示会员卡或卡号。</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="244" top="1300" width="900" height="20"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="14" color="#2C3B31FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">产地：全部来自 3 号楼屋顶 46 个种植箱，采收日期标在每项下方。</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="244" top="1326" width="900" height="20"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="14" color="#2C3B31FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">保鲜：叶菜请当日冷藏；香草可插水杯存放 3–5 天。</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="244" top="1352" width="900" height="20"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="14" color="#2C3B31FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">包装：请自备袋子，摊位提供可循环菜筐（押金 10 元）。</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="244" top="1378" width="900" height="20"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="14" color="#2C3B31FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">收入：扣包装与耗材后，余款进入种子基金，用于下季采购与工作坊。</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="244" top="1410"><Container width="900" height="1" color="#E3DED0FF"/></Positioned>
